@base = http://localhost:8080
@merchantId = 1
@templateId = 1
@couponId = replace-with-coupon-id
@orderId = replace-with-order-id
@taskId = replace-with-task-id

### 服务状态
GET {{base}}/api/status

### 商家登录，账号和密码写入 IDEA 私有环境
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{merchantUsername}}","password":"{{merchantPassword}}"}

> {% client.global.set("merchantToken", response.body.token); %}

### 用户登录
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{customerUsername}}","password":"{{customerPassword}}"}

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.token); %}

### 商家建立满减券，更新有效期毫秒时间
POST {{base}}/api/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId":{{merchantId}},"name":"新客满100减20","stock":100,"thresholdCents":10000,"discountCents":2000,"validFrom":1794787200000,"validTo":1826323200000}

### 用户领取，异步接口返回 202 和请求编号
POST {{base}}/api/claims/async
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"templateId":{{templateId}},"requestId":"{{$uuid}}"}

> {% client.global.set("claimRequest", response.body.request_id); %}

### 查询领取结果
GET {{base}}/api/claims/{{claimRequest}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 我的优惠券
GET {{base}}/api/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 查看结算可用券
GET {{base}}/api/settlement?merchantId={{merchantId}}&amountCents=10000
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 用户锁券
POST {{base}}/api/coupons/{{couponId}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"{{orderId}}","merchantId":{{merchantId}},"amountCents":10000}

### 商家查询本店订单用券状态
GET {{base}}/api/redemptions/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### 商家确认核销
POST {{base}}/api/redemptions/{{orderId}}/redeem
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### 商家确认退券
POST {{base}}/api/redemptions/{{orderId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### 商家近期任务
GET {{base}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### 商家查询或恢复任务
GET {{base}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### 退出当前用户会话
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
